* ADI LTC7001 model power-loss and recovery probe; linear gate-load approximation only.
* VCC is held at 12 V for 1 s before INP is asserted; INP remains high through VCC loss and recovery.
.include LTC7001.sub
Vcc vcc 0 PWL(0 0 1u 12 1.02 12 1.020001 0 1.08 0 1.080001 12 1.12 12)
Vin inp 0 PWL(0 0 0.999999 0 1.000000 3.3 1.120 3.3)
Xiso vcc 0 0 inp 0 gate tgup 0 bst LTC7001
Rup tgup gate 10k
Rgs gate 0 1Meg
Cgs gate 0 32.1n
Cbst bst 0 1u
.tran 0 1.12 0 50u
.save V(vcc) V(gate) V(bst) V(inp) V(tgup)
.meas tran vcc_before_loss FIND V(vcc) AT=1.019
.meas tran gate_before_loss FIND V(gate) AT=1.019
.meas tran bst_before_loss FIND V(bst) AT=1.019
.meas tran vcc_during_loss FIND V(vcc) AT=1.050
.meas tran gate_during_loss FIND V(gate) AT=1.050
.meas tran bst_during_loss FIND V(bst) AT=1.050
.meas tran vcc_after_recovery FIND V(vcc) AT=1.100
.meas tran gate_after_recovery FIND V(gate) AT=1.100
.meas tran bst_after_recovery FIND V(bst) AT=1.100
.end
